From 4529a14aebdafd15bbadd92c4791c167df05dc05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "A. Reader" <reader@example.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:36:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH bpf-next 8/8] selftests/bpf: Add count-min sketch map
 benchmark

Measure push and peek on a count-min sketch against counting the same
keys in a hash and an LRU hash, the way a program counts events per
key: look up, add in place, insert once.

  ./bench -p 1 count-min-push --cms_width 2719 --cms_depth 5
  ./bench -p 1 count-min-hash --cms_nr_keys 100000
